{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ControlAccounts\">Control Accounts</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Assets ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is On To ToDate\">Control accounts for <em>intangible assets</em> help you manage non-physical assets at their historical cost.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Assets Automatic Balance BalanceSheet Count Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets To ToDate Total\">These accounts automatically summarize the total purchase value of all your <em>intangible assets</em> in a single <em>balance sheet</em> account.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Assets ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count General_ledger Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On Sent Summary To ToDate Total TotalCost\">Control accounts are summary accounts in the <em>general ledger</em> that represent the total cost of all individual <em>intangible assets</em> in the subsidiary ledger.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Assets Automatic Balance BalanceSheet ControlAccount Count Date Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On To ToDate\">An <em>intangible asset control account</em> automatically consolidates the purchase value of all intangible assets into a single <em>balance sheet</em> account.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets\">What Are Intangible Assets?</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Business Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On To ToDate\">Intangible assets are non-physical assets that provide value to your business, such as:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And\">• Patents and trademarks</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"License\">• Software licenses</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">• Goodwill</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer On To ToDate\">• Customer relationships</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And\">• Copyrights and intellectual property</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count On\">Naming Your Control Accounts</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Name Type\">Use descriptive names that clearly identify the type of intangible assets being tracked:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And\">• 'Intellectual Property' for patents and copyrights</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"License\">• 'Software Licenses' for purchased software</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is\">• 'Patents & Trademarks' for registered intellectual property</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Is On\">• 'Goodwill' for business acquisition premiums</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer On To ToDate\">• 'Customer Relationships' for acquired customer bases</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Benefits</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Assets ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On\">Using control accounts for intangible assets provides:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets On\">• Organized management of non-physical assets</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Port\">• Simplified financial reporting</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Is Off On To ToDate WriteOff\">• Automatic tracking of acquisitions and write-offs</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"General_ledger Line\">• Detailed subsidiary records while keeping the <em>general ledger</em> streamlined</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Best Practices</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count Create Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset On Rate Rent To ToDate\">Create separate control accounts for different intangible asset categories to facilitate:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization Assets On\">• <em>Amortization</em> scheduling (finite life vs. indefinite life assets)</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">• Impairment testing requirements</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account And Count\">• Compliance with accounting standards</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Assets Is On\">• Distinction between purchased and internally developed assets</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Group\">Group</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Group\">Group</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Balance BalanceSheet ControlAccount Count Group HasWhere Is On Port Reports\">The <em>balance sheet</em> group where this control account will appear in your financial reports.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "intangible-asset-control-accounts"
}
